<!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
<header class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="brand">
      <img src="/assets/logo/logo-delead-dark.png" alt="De' Lead International">
      <span>DLI Students</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#catalogue">Catalogue</a>
      <a href="#delivery">Delivery</a>
      <a href="#heroes">Outcomes</a>
      <a href="/professionals">Professionals</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="nav-back" href="/">&larr; DLI Education</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-magenta nav-desk" href="/">&larr; DLI Education</a>
      <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#contact">Enquire</a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <h1 class="h1">#anyonecancode.<br>Here is where.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Technology courses that run on real projects and a mentor per learner. From a first line of Python to a working robot, a live website or a trained model.</p>
    <div class="hero-paths">
      <a class="hp-students" href="#catalogue">See the catalogue
        <svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
      <a class="hp-pros" href="/professionals">For professionals
        <svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-cols">
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <h3><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-bot"/></svg> Real robots, real code</h3>
        <p>Every course ends with something that runs. Small groups or 1-to-1, and a completion certificate at the end.</p>
        <div class="avatars"><span>PY</span><span>3D</span><span>AI</span><span>JS</span><span>+</span></div>
        <div class="hi-count">11 course tracks, four families</div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-figure">
        <svg class="squiggle" viewBox="0 0 220 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M14 224c-4-48 26-84 70-84 40 0 58 44 22 66-30 18-70-8-46-44 20-30 74-40 128-96" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <img src="/assets/photos/session-4.webp" alt="Students building projects in a DLI Education session">
        <span class="photo-tag pt-1">Project-first</span>
        <span class="photo-tag pt-2">Mentor per learner</span>
      </figure>

      <div class="hero-aside">
        <div class="hero-blobs"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <p>Fundamentals and clean thinking come before frameworks, so what learners pick up transfers to whatever tool is next.</p>
        <a href="#catalogue" class="btn">See the catalogue
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7V16"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead reveal">
      <div><span class="kicker">How it works</span><h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:10px">Built to be done, not just attended</h2></div>
      <div class="deco" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg></div>
      <p class="sh-note">Every track is a build. A mentor tracks each learner, and everyone who finishes gets certified.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tgrid c3">
      <article class="tcard lime reveal">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></span>
        <h3>A project every track</h3>
        <p>An app, a site, a model, a robot. The theory is taught through the build, not a deck.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tcard lav reveal">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-users"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Mentor per learner</h3>
        <p>Group sizes stay small, and 1-to-1 is available on every track.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tcard rose reveal">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-graduation"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Certificate on completion</h3>
        <p>Every learner who finishes a track receives a completion certificate from De' Lead International.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CATALOGUE ============ -->
<section class="section" id="catalogue">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">Eleven tracks, four families</h2>
      <p class="sh-note">Durations shown where fixed. Most tracks run group or 1-to-1, online or offline, and adapt to a camp or a school.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="filters reveal">
      <span class="filter active">All</span>
      <span class="filter">AI &amp; Data</span>
      <span class="filter">Coding &amp; Web</span>
      <span class="filter">Design</span>
      <span class="filter">Robotics &amp; Kids</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cgrid reveal">
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top lime"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">AI &amp; Data</div><h4>Gen AI for Smart Learning</h4><p class="cc-desc">Prompt engineering, smart study techniques, memory and visual learning, ethical AI use.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 13+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">2 months</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top rose"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">AI &amp; Data</div><h4>Artificial Intelligence for All</h4><p class="cc-desc">How models learn, everyday AI tools, building simple projects, ethics and limitations.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">Concepts first</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top peach"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chart"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">AI &amp; Data</div><h4>Python for Data Analytics</h4><p class="cc-desc">Statistics fundamentals, data management, exploratory analysis, visualisation, capstone projects.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 14+ &bull; 4 to 5 months</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">48 to 60 hrs</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top teal"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chart"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">AI &amp; Data</div><h4>Data &amp; Analytics</h4><p class="cc-desc">Reading, cleaning and presenting data, and building dashboards a team can actually use.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 14+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">Dashboards</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>

      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top lime"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Coding &amp; Web</div><h4>Python Programming</h4><p class="cc-desc">Core fundamentals, problem solving, control structures, data structures, file and exception handling.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; 3 to 4 months</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top rose"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Coding &amp; Web</div><h4>Web Development</h4><p class="cc-desc">HTML foundation, CSS and Bootstrap, JavaScript and jQuery, frameworks, deployment.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; 4 to 5 months</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 to 48 hrs</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top peach"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-wifi"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Coding &amp; Web</div><h4>Internet of Things</h4><p class="cc-desc">Microcontrollers, sensors and actuators, connectivity, build a connected device.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 13+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">Hardware included</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>

      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top lav"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-box"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Design</div><h4>3D Design &amp; Modeling</h4><p class="cc-desc">Modelling fundamentals, design and sculpting, texturing and rendering, architecture, product design.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; 3 to 4 months</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top teal"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-palette"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Design</div><h4>UI/UX Designing</h4><p class="cc-desc">User research, wireframing, visual design, prototyping.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 14+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">Prototype</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>

      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top lime"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-bot"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Robotics &amp; Kids</div><h4>Robotics</h4><p class="cc-desc">Electronics and sensors, mechanical design, robot programming, innovation projects. Prepares for STEM careers.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 10+ &bull; 3 to 4 months</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
      <article class="ccard"><div class="cc-top rose"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-grid"/></svg></div><div class="cc-rate">Robotics &amp; Kids</div><h4>Block Based Coding for Kids</h4><p class="cc-desc">Scratch, Code.org, PictoBlox, EduBlocks. Computational thinking without syntax errors.</p><p class="cc-meta">Ages 7+ &bull; 3 to 4 months</p><div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Enquire</a></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ DELIVERY ============ -->
<section class="section" id="delivery">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">Four ways to take a course</h2>
      <p class="sh-note">The curriculum is the same in every format. What changes is the room.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tgrid c3">
      <article class="tcard peach reveal"><span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-monitor"/></svg></span><h3>Online</h3><p>Live, mentor-led classes from anywhere, group or 1-to-1.</p></article>
      <article class="tcard lav reveal"><span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-building"/></svg></span><h3>Offline</h3><p>In-person at a centre, with hardware provided for robotics and IoT tracks.</p></article>
      <article class="tcard lime reveal"><span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-tent"/></svg></span><h3>Camps</h3><p>Condensed into a residential or day camp format for a cohort.</p></article>
      <article class="tcard teal reveal"><span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-briefcase"/></svg></span><h3>Corporate workshops</h3><p>Run for a company or an institution as a focused workshop.</p></article>
      <article class="tcard rose reveal"><span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-target"/></svg></span><h3>Whichever fits</h3><p>Tell us the learner and the schedule, and we shape the track around it.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SUPER HEROES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="heroes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Our super heroes</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:10px">Students who took it somewhere</h2>
      <p class="sh-note">Real learners from DLI Education classrooms, in India and the UAE.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ogrid reveal">
      <figure class="ocard"><div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">MA</span><div><div class="o-name">Muhammed Adhil T S</div><div class="o-where">GUPS Thurayoor, Kerala</div></div></div><p class="o-win">Champion at the TechTop International Bootcamp, held at Kerala Startup Mission's Maker Village, Kochi.</p><span class="o-tag">Robotics</span></figure>
      <figure class="ocard"><div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">AM</span><div><div class="o-name">Ameya M</div><div class="o-where">GGVHS Feroke, Kerala</div></div></div><p class="o-win">Champion at the TechTop International Bootcamp, held at Kerala Startup Mission's Maker Village, Kochi.</p><span class="o-tag">Robotics</span></figure>
      <figure class="ocard"><div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">EV</span><div><div class="o-name">Evana Eliza Vinoj</div><div class="o-where">Sharjah Indian School, UAE</div></div></div><p class="o-win">Digitised an entire village library with a Python application. Won the Sharjah Award for Educational Excellence, Distinguished Student, with a Dh30,000 scholarship.</p><span class="o-tag">Python</span></figure>
      <figure class="ocard"><div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">AN</span><div><div class="o-name">Aamil Nazar</div><div class="o-where">GHSS Medical College Campus, Kozhikode</div></div></div><p class="o-win">Built his school's website and was honoured by Kerala's education minister. Two-time winner of the state-level web design competition.</p><span class="o-tag">Web development</span></figure>
      <figure class="ocard"><div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">AK</span><div><div class="o-name">Abhinav Krishna</div><div class="o-where">Kozhikode, India</div></div></div><p class="o-win">Inspire Award for a Money Sanitizer Machine built with robotics. Designed an automatic waste-collection machine prototype for city workers.</p><span class="o-tag">Robotics</span></figure>
      <figure class="ocard"><div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">NV</span><div><div class="o-name">Neeraj V M</div><div class="o-where">GHSS Koduvayoor, Kerala</div></div></div><p class="o-win">Built a weather application in Python and completed a machine-learning project at the age of 14.</p><span class="o-tag">Python &amp; ML</span></figure>
    </div>
    <p class="qnote">These are a few of the stories. Every line of code brings another.</p>
  </div>
</section>

